/*
 * Kernel build options for the OMAP4470 (SGX544 rev 112) Android build.
 *
 * Generated by the DDK's own build system (eurasiacon/build/linux2/
 * omap_android, "make autogen TARGET_DEVICE=blaze_tablet.4470"); the
 * result is the same for PLATFORM_RELEASE 4.4 to 8.1. Options that change
 * a structure shared with user space or the microkernel (sgx_options.h,
 * the bridge headers, sgxinfo.h) must stay as generated, or the closed
 * user space fails its compatibility checks or, worse, misreads the
 * bridge. Changes from the generated file are marked.
 */

